                    tempOutputDir = null;
                    String zipFilename = filename + "_convertedToImages.zip";
                    return WebResponseUtils.bytesToWebResponse(
                            zipBAOS.toByteArray(), zipFilename, MediaType.APPLICATION_OCTET_STREAM);
